-/// its engine thread). Null in Status unless a tier or grouping is on. Totals unless in `gauges`.
+/// its engine thread). Null in Status unless a tier or grouping is on, or TF_DS_CACHE_METRICS is (then regardless of
+/// tier). Totals unless in `gauges`.
